        "subject":"=Re: {{ $('Calculate Explainable Score').item.json.requested_service.replaceAll('_',' ') }} enquiry",
        "message":"=Hi {{ $('Calculate Explainable Score').item.json.first_name }},\n\nThank you for contacting Northstar Automation Studio about {{ $('Calculate Explainable Score').item.json.requested_service.replaceAll('_',' ') }}. We have reviewed your enquiry and would like to discuss your goals and current process in more detail.\n\nWould you be available for a short discovery call?\n\nBest regards,\nNorthstar Automation Studio",
